 es_Bog_Official?window=BOG_DAY1\n\nThe road to glory leads to Copenhagen.
  On October 24–25\, 2026\, the world's top 16 mobile players will gather 
 at BLAST Studios in Denmark for the Fortnite Mobile Series LAN Championsh
 ip. After months of fierce competition\, the best players from across the
  globe will face off on LAN in Reload Solos\, battling for the ultimate t
 itle. Every elimination matters. Every placement counts. Only one player 
 will rise above the rest and be crowned the 2026 Fortnite Mobile Series C
 hampion.
