BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:View Leaderboards:\nhttps://fortnitetracker.com/events/epicgam
 es_S43_FNCSSoloReloadQualifiers_EU?window=S43_FNCSSoloReloadQualifiers_Qu
 al1Round1Day1_EU\n\nDrop into the FNCS Solos Reload! The competition kick
 s off with Round 1\, featuring two sessions—Day 1 and Day 2. Eligible pla
 yers must rank within the top 200\,000 on the Global Power Rankings Leade
 rboard. Players ranked in the top 1\,000 Global PR may skip Round 1 and a
 utomatically qualify for Round 2\; however\, choosing to compete in Round
  1 forfeits that automatic qualification. After both Round 1 sessions con
 clude\, scores from Day 1 and Day 2 will be combined. The top players on 
 the cumulative leaderboard will advance to Round 2: Top 4\,000 EU\; Top 2
 \,000 NAC\; and Top 1\,000 OCE\, ASIA\, ME\, BR\, and NAW. Round 2 featur
 es the players who advanced from Round 1 alongside eligible Top 1\,000 Gl
 obal PR players who skipped Round 1. At the end of Round 2\, the top 500 
 players in each region will advance to Round 3. Round 3 is the final roun
 d of the Qualifier\, with the top 80 players in each region advancing dir
 ectly to the Heats. Players who competed in the Qualifier but did not adv
 ance to the Heats will still have another opportunity to qualify through 
 the Last Chance Qualifier (LCQ). Good luck and have fun!
DTEND:20261103T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T012744Z
DTSTART:20261103T180000Z
SEQUENCE:0
