BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:View Leaderboards:\nhttps://fortnitetracker.com/events/epicgam
 es_S43_FNCSSoloReload_HeatsStage_EU?window=S43_FNCSSoloReload_HeatsStage_
 Heat1_EU\n\nHeat up your path to the FNCS Solos Reload Final! The Heats b
 ring together 80 players per region who advanced from Round 3 of the Qual
 ifier. Players will be split across two Heats\, with 40 players competing
  in each Heat. Each Heat features eight matches. Each match offers a dire
 ct path to the Final: the player who earns a Victory Royale automatically
  advances to the FNCS Solos Reload Final. A player who has already secure
 d a spot in the Final through a Victory Royale cannot earn another Final 
 spot by winning another match. After each Heat concludes\, the top seven 
 highest-scoring players who did not earn a Victory Royale will also advan
 ce to the Final\, bringing the total to 15 players from each Heat. The ne
 xt 10 players from each Heat who did not qualify for the Final will earn 
 a bye directly to the Last Chance Qualifier Final. Good luck and have fun
 !
DTEND:20261114T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T012744Z
DTSTART:20261114T180000Z
SEQUENCE:0
