BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:View Leaderboards:\nhttps://fortnitetracker.com/events/epicgam
 es_S43_FNCSSoloReload_LastChanceQualifier_EU?window=S43_FNCSSoloReload_La
 stChanceQualifier_EU\n\nKeep your FNCS Solos Reload journey alive in the 
 Last Chance Qualifier! LCQ Round 1 is open to players who participated in
  the FNCS Solos Reload Qualifier and have not already advanced to the LCQ
  Final or the FNCS Solos Reload Final. After LCQ Round 1 concludes\, the 
 top 20 players in each region will advance to the LCQ Final\, where they 
 will join 20 players who earned a bye through the Heats\, creating a 40-p
 layer lobby. The LCQ Final features five matches. Every match provides a 
 direct path to the Final: the player who earns the Victory Royale will im
 mediately qualify for the FNCS Solos Reload Final. A player who has alrea
 dy secured a Final spot through a Victory Royale cannot earn a second Vic
 tory Royale qualification spot. After the LCQ Final concludes\, the next 
 five highest-scoring players who have not earned a Victory Royale will al
 so advance to the FNCS Solos Reload Final\, for a total of 10 qualifying 
 players from the LCQ Final. This is your last chance to secure a spot—goo
 d luck and have fun!
DTEND:20261116T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T012744Z
DTSTART:20261116T180000Z
