DESCRIPTION:View Leaderboards:\nhttps://fortnitetracker.com/events/epicgam
 es_S42_FNCSSolo_LastChanceQualifier_EU?window=S42_FNCSSolo_LastChanceQual
 ifier_EU\n\nKeep your FNCS Solos journey alive in the Last Chance Qualifi
 er! LCQ Round 1 is open to eligible players who participated in an FNCS S
 olos Qualifier Round 1 session but have not already advanced to the LCQ F
 inal or the FNCS Solos Finals. Players will compete in a single three-hou
 r session with up to 11 matches. After the session concludes\, the top 70
  players in each region will advance to the LCQ Final. The LCQ Final last
 s approximately two and a half hours and features up to five matches. Eve
 ry match provides a direct path to the Finals: the player who earns the V
 ictory Royale will receive 1\,000 points and immediately qualify for the 
 FNCS Solos Finals. Once qualified through a Victory Royale\, that player 
 may not compete in any remaining LCQ Final matches. After the LCQ Final c
 oncludes\, the next 17 highest-scoring players who have not earned a Vict
 ory Royale will also advance to the FNCS Solos Finals. This is your last 
 chance to secure a spot—good luck and have fun!
DTEND:20261019T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T012744Z
DTSTART:20261019T170000Z
SEQUENCE:0
