 es_S42_FNCSSolo_HeatsStage_EU?window=S42_FNCSSolo_HeatsStage_Heat1_EU\n\n
 Heat up your path to the FNCS Solos Finals! The Heats bring together 200 
 players per region: 92 players from the Fast Track and 108 players from Q
 ualifier 2. Players will be seeded across two Heats based on their respec
 tive leaderboard placements\, with 100 players competing in each Heat. Ea
 ch Heat lasts approximately three hours and features up to six matches. E
 very match offers a direct path to the Finals: the player who earns the V
 ictory Royale will receive 1\,000 points and immediately qualify for the 
 FNCS Solos Finals. Once qualified through a Victory Royale\, that player 
 may not compete in any remaining Heat matches. After each Heat concludes\
 , the next 29 highest-scoring players who have not earned a Victory Royal
 e will also advance to the Finals. Players finishing 36th through 50th on
  the Heat leaderboard will advance to the Last Chance Qualifier Final. Go
 od luck and have fun!
DTEND:20261017T154000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T012744Z
DTSTART:20261017T130000Z
