 es_S42_FNCSSoloQualifiers_EU?window=S42_FNCSSoloQualifiers_Qual1Round1Day
 1_EU\n\nDrop into the FNCS Solos! The competition kicks off with Round 1\
 , featuring two three-hour sessions—Day 1 and Day 2—with up to 11 matches
  per session. Eligible players must rank within the top 200\,000 on the o
 verall Power Rankings Leaderboard. Players ranked in the top 2\,000 may s
 kip Round 1 and automatically qualify for Round 2\; however\, choosing to
  compete in Round 1 forfeits that automatic qualification.  After both Ro
 und 1 sessions conclude\, scores from Day 1 and Day 2 will be combined. T
 he top players on the cumulative leaderboard will advance to Round 2: Top
  8\,000 EU\; Top 4\,000 NAC\; and Top 2\,000 OCE\, ASIA\, ME\, BR\, and N
 AW.  Round 2 consists of one three-hour session with up to 11 matches. At
  the end of the session\, the top 1\,000 players in each region will adva
 nce to Round 3.  Round 3 also features one three-hour session with up to 
 11 matches. In Qualifier 1\, the top 100 players on the Round 3 leaderboa
 rd will advance to Fast Track. In Qualifier 2\, the top 108 players will 
 advance to Heats. Good luck and have fun!
DTEND:20260928T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T012744Z
DTSTART:20260928T170000Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:[EU]  FNCS Solos Qualifiers   Day 1 Round 1
